cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Coral reef tipping points: a synthetic coral–macroalgae–herbivore resilience model"
abstract: >-
  A coral–macroalgae–herbivore model built with synthetic data to test a
  resilience-analysis workflow: bifurcation and basin analysis, stochastic
  transitions, early-warning signals, Lyapunov estimates, parameter estimation,
  identifiability, global sensitivity and management scenarios.
authors:
